OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by Christmas Eve pub
OL,4,Apush, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reveller died when he hit his head
OL,7,Fafter being pushed over in a pub beer
OL,8,Fgarden on Christmas Eve, a jury has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FSteven Shevels, 61, was immediately
OL,12,Fknocked unconscious by the fall behind
OL,13,FThe Queen's Head in Willington, County
OL,14,FDurham, on 24 December, Teesside Crown
OL,15,FCourt heard.
OL,17,FMartin Greensmith, 37 and from
OL,18,FWillington, denies manslaughter, with
OL,19,Fjurors having heard he had allegedly
OL,20,Fjust been told the victim was his
OL,21,Ffather shortly before the fatal
OL,22,Faltercation.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
