OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by Christmas Eve pub
OL,4,Apush, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors saw CCTV footage of Greensmith
OL,7,Fshoving Shevels over and then pub goers
OL,8,Ftrying to resuscitate the victim, with
OL,9,Fthe accused also trying to shake him
OL,10,Fawake.
